a is crafted as a self-contained story, with more stories and worlds planned over time. The focus is on mood, presence, and emotional resonance\u2014designed to feel cinematic, poetic, and immersive.\n\nKey Features:\n1) Mixed-reality storytelling that blends seamlessly with your real environment.\n2) Hands-only interaction using natural gestures.\n3) Calm, cinematic visuals and sound design.\n4) Narrative-driven experiences focused on atmosphere and meaning.\n5) Designed for relaxed, mindful exploration\n\nUse in a safe, clear space and remain aware of your surroundings. Ozythra is best experienced at your own pace, allowing the story to unfold naturally around you.", "short_description": "Ozythra is a mixed-reality storytelling experience where nature and science gently intertwine. Explore poetic, hands-only interactions that unfold living stories in your real space."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xtrofttech.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xtroft Tech Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xtrofttech.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24536815022666863"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1587188245520165"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1587188245520165"}, "is_approved": true, "firstO